{"Hi there! What can I get you today?":"c4d727ba903a.mp3","Hi! What can I get you?":"0af3b0efc198.mp3","Can I get a flat white, please? For here, thanks.":"4878b85a422a.mp3","Morning rush at a busy café. The queue clears and it's your turn — the barista looks up at you.. Order a flat white, for here.":"42e25212176a.mp3","Hi there, what would you like?":"9e476ac26946.mp3","Can I get a large latte to take away, please?":"81f8287fab1d.mp3","You're in a hurry. You step up to the counter.. Order a large latte, takeaway.":"9b939373d9dc.mp3","Are you ready to order?":"ea4cd71f5ecc.mp3","Can I get the burger, please? Could I get it without onion?":"37b0317c1a12.mp3","You're seated at a restaurant. The waiter comes over with a smile.. Order the burger — no onion.":"a8e0b58022f2.mp3","Have you decided what you'd like?":"ce8f2e3c8e80.mp3","What would you recommend?":"9ef8ccc88e4a.mp3","The menu's huge and you can't decide. The waiter waits patiently.. Ask what they'd recommend.":"5492be442ad8.mp3","Excuse me, could we get the bill, please?":"e69d6609de53.mp3","You've finished eating. You catch the waiter's eye across the room.. Ask for the bill.":"efcd8ec87486.mp3","Good evening, Bella's Restaurant.":"a60a9c4e1d40.mp3","Hi, I'd like to book a table for two at seven, please.":"9ec41c01cf32.mp3","You're calling a restaurant to book for tonight.. Book a table for two at seven.":"7130fcaeb95a.mp3","Are you finished with that?":"07b1e2c1f7f6.mp3","Could I get this to go, please?":"6f1a7158db50.mp3","You're full but there's food left. The waiter comes to clear the plates.. Ask to take it away.":"f4f4e46fadc9.mp3","Hi there! Are you looking for anything in particular?":"4bf1b46617c9.mp3","I'm just browsing, thanks.":"fe3df6f0dc8a.mp3","You wander into a shop. A staff member comes straight over to you.. Say you're just looking.":"f5fbe10169e6.mp3","Can I help you find anything?":"c8fcc7128083.mp3","Sorry, where can I find the milk?":"8cc9db589126.mp3","You can't find what you need in the supermarket. A worker walks past.. Ask where the milk is.":"34963dd7bf07.mp3","Excuse me, how much is this?":"0c4ac88088de.mp3","You're holding something with no price tag. A shop assistant is nearby.. Ask how much it is.":"4c80a046c9ae.mp3","Let me know if you need a hand.":"84b4c52b73b5.mp3","Do you have this in a medium?":"f1f559bbe90b.mp3","The shirt looks good but it's the wrong size. Staff are close by.. Ask for a medium.":"4ae740cf2c79.mp3","That'll be twelve dollars.":"0e0e24fe524f.mp3","Can I pay by card?":"c540068fa74b.mp3","You're at the register. The cashier rings up your things.. Say you'll pay by card.":"1d8ad812c7c1.mp3","Anything else for you?":"692cadf0b169.mp3","No, that's all. Could I get a bag, please?":"dea4091fb625.mp3","You've paid. The cashier hands over your things loose.. Ask for a bag.":"67e9aec9e35c.mp3","Hi, how can I help you today?":"ca61c0ca456b.mp3","I'd like to return this for a refund, please.":"05e2e956ab86.mp3","You're back at the shop with something you bought. Staff greet you.. Return it for a refund.":"4992f8e7b819.mp3","What seems to be the problem?":"0f7fb8555fc6.mp3","This one's faulty — it stopped working after a week.":"d90921f7d8d7.mp3","The gadget broke after a week. You bring it to the counter.. Explain it's faulty.":"6152fae80bba.mp3","How's everything tasting?":"740ec0584460.mp3","Sorry, I think this isn't what I ordered.":"b521468679bf.mp3","The waiter sets down a plate — but it's not what you ordered.. Politely say it's wrong.":"72b0d9e7db5a.mp3","Is everything alright with the bill?":"f2901d3f3dae.mp3","Sorry, I think there's a mistake on the bill.":"9767576fc0c4.mp3","You scan the bill and the total looks off. The waiter checks in.. Point out the mistake.":"b0fc3b033a48.mp3","Hi, thanks for calling — how can I help?":"7740a5a22bdc.mp3","Hi, my order hasn't arrived yet — could you check on it?":"693df95119d4.mp3","Your online order never arrived. You call the shop.. Ask them to check on it.":"08db1b356bd9.mp3","Excuse me, do you know how to get to the station?":"db94a2d26235.mp3","You're lost on the street. A stranger stands nearby.. Ask the way to the station.":"60e5c5b85e81.mp3","Excuse me, does this bus go to the city?":"906d313ac888.mp3","A bus pulls up but you're not sure it's yours. Someone waits beside you.. Check if it goes to the city.":"23ada013c245.mp3","Where to?":"b97bb28edc1a.mp3","One ticket to Central, please.":"f57cf1faf038.mp3","You're at the ticket window.. Buy one ticket to Central.":"504e8c07ec64.mp3","Excuse me, is this the right platform for the airport line?":"de2539e6c12b.mp3","You're on a platform, unsure it's the right one. A staff member walks by.. Check the platform.":"01a898295725.mp3","Where to, mate?":"c243987314d4.mp3","Could you take me to the airport, please?":"c98b085a2cb4.mp3","You get into a taxi. The driver turns around to you.. Tell them the airport.":"fc508d4b47bd.mp3","Where are you getting off?":"989a16ff7bcc.mp3","I'm getting off at Central — could you let me know when we're there?":"2fd7b4f0094b.mp3","You're on the bus, worried about missing your stop. The driver asks where you're headed.. Say your stop and ask them to remind you.":"ac2dd6d9a207.mp3","Good morning, City Clinic, how can I help?":"23c45181c451.mp3","Hi, I'd like to book an appointment, please.":"e1137d4372ce.mp3","You're calling a clinic to see a doctor.. Book an appointment.":"cd063a4a17f9.mp3","Good morning, how can I help?":"44e7fd4ac840.mp3","Hi, I need to reschedule my appointment, please.":"1cc63274b690.mp3","Something came up — you need to move your appointment. You call in.. Reschedule it.":"ddadf62a49c8.mp3","Hello?":"dedd3af50f5f.mp3","Hi, could I speak to Sarah, please?":"afbe8c5f5851.mp3","You call an office and someone picks up.. Ask for Sarah.":"a2e33f29fbf9.mp3","Sorry, she's not in right now.":"fda258c881e9.mp3","No worries — could you tell her I called?":"841505e8deab.mp3","The person you want isn't there right now.. Leave a message.":"236ceaaa85ab.mp3","Hi! What are we doing today?":"760d9901b983.mp3","Just a trim, please — not too short.":"157b80c889a1.mp3","You're in the chair. The hairdresser asks what you want.. Ask for a small trim.":"fde2b815e161.mp3","Delivery for you — where would you like it?":"8e89cff18960.mp3","Thanks — could you leave it at the door, please?":"df9626ddc713.mp3","A courier's at your door with a parcel.. Ask them to leave it at the door.":"d21b1a72d553.mp3","Morning! How was your weekend?":"22bf74557a8e.mp3","Yeah, pretty good, thanks. How about you?":"f9f2f45ca7d2.mp3","Monday morning at work. A colleague turns to you with a smile.. Answer, then ask back.":"4551f1daaede.mp3","Hi, I don't think we've met.":"bd8ec5d9f481.mp3","Hi, I'm [your name] — nice to meet you.":"fd55e654225d.mp3","At a party, someone you don't know steps over and says hi.. Introduce yourself with your name.":"9c0982a25834.mp3","Hey! Long time no see!":"6698a5bb150d.mp3","I know, it's been ages! How've you been?":"c73d6df47fd6.mp3","You bump into an old friend on the street.. React and ask how they've been.":"708c017252fb.mp3","Lovely day, isn't it?":"d0a2a0bbc7a5.mp3","Yeah, gorgeous — makes a nice change!":"4b927e354377.mp3","In the lift, a neighbour makes small talk.. Chat back about the weather.":"70c195ea8217.mp3","Hey, how's it going?":"8e05a7fff842.mp3","Not bad, thanks — keeping busy. You?":"575db468f015.mp3","A familiar face passes and asks how you are.. Answer and return it.":"06f22de86a70.mp3","...yeah, anyway.":"5484f0217e4e.mp3","Anyway, I'd better get going. See you around!":"0b61034adaa9.mp3","The conversation's winding down. You'd like to leave politely.. Wrap up and say bye.":"a4becd767f40.mp3","Here you go!":"f9223dda8d02.mp3","Thanks so much, I really appreciate it.":"8fc65ca677bb.mp3","Someone just went out of their way to help you.. Thank them warmly.":"7a3e30ce0cd0.mp3","...so that's roughly the plan. Any thoughts?":"165ab625b382.mp3","Just a quick thought — I think we could...":"ca9325d23f6f.mp3","Someone finishes presenting. There's a short pause in the room.. Jump in with an idea.":"963a7e9799bd.mp3","...so does that make sense?":"986f8ae0bd52.mp3","Yeah, I think that makes a lot of sense.":"25c0097386ac.mp3","A colleague checks whether their plan makes sense to you.. Agree with it.":"fd91f9079df5.mp3","...what do you reckon?":"dbc9ea8a8823.mp3","I see your point, but I'm not so sure about that.":"8111ec4c24d0.mp3","You don't quite agree, but you want to stay polite.. Push back gently.":"9603fe2129a0.mp3","...you know what I mean?":"aa4eb2c1ee73.mp3","Sorry, could you clarify what you mean by that?":"15e238f24387.mp3","They said something and you didn't follow what they meant.. Ask them to clarify.":"40af5caa44c1.mp3","Can you get this done by Friday?":"04ce5b2e9bd2.mp3","That's a bit tight — could I have until Monday?":"72c443ec659b.mp3","Your boss wants it by Friday — that's too tight.. Ask for until Monday.":"458c8e7cbcb6.mp3","Have you got a minute? I could use a hand with something.":"939fee402564.mp3","You're stuck and need a hand from a colleague nearby.. Ask for a minute of help.":"83d9ba20e00c.mp3","Sorry love, we're all outta that, d'ya wanna go the oat milk instead?":"6f26f06aa797.mp3","Sorry, could you say that again?":"5cfff3bc6bb6.mp3","The barista rattles something off fast and you miss it.. Ask them to repeat.":"e89e4a99b780.mp3","...and then just send it over to the other team, yeah?":"915babea7885.mp3","Sorry, I didn't quite catch that last bit.":"ccb8fd4db251.mp3","They reel off instructions; you catch most but lose the end.. Ask about the last part.":"ee223dd9b604.mp3","So if you just fill out this form and bring it back by Thursday, that'd be great.":"56bababd5df9.mp3","Sorry, could you speak a bit more slowly, please?":"4bc7f5c5b48b.mp3","They're talking way too fast for you to follow.. Ask them to slow down.":"ad05f52715b4.mp3","...so let's just push it to next week.":"c9a38312e9c4.mp3","So just to check, you mean...?":"67bf03857e02.mp3","You want to make sure you got their point right.. Check you understood.":"bd9d16232a27.mp3","Hi, checking in?":"e8578ba2e697.mp3","Yes, I've got a reservation.":"f8d00ce0698d.mp3","You arrive at the hotel front desk after a long trip.. Check in with your booking.":"9ab7db9ae1f8.mp3","Reception, how can I help?":"9a1259dc1dbe.mp3","Hi, the air-con in my room isn't working.":"0df51beb440a.mp3","The air-con in your room is dead. You call reception.. Report the problem.":"59a150b8bafa.mp3","Morning! How was your stay?":"b7da0a85ca5a.mp3","Great, thanks. I'd like to check out, please.":"5daa26c1b8ec.mp3","You're leaving. You come to the front desk.. Check out.":"4fe924584f2e.mp3","What brings you in today?":"3aa83727af75.mp3","I've had a sore throat for a few days.":"fd1ab2754333.mp3","You're at the doctor's. They sit down and look at you.. Say what's wrong.":"ecfd2d75ea18.mp3","Hi, how can I help?":"85469e9c7025.mp3","Do you have anything for a headache?":"6bdb8509fdda.mp3","You're at the pharmacy counter, feeling unwell.. Ask for something for a headache.":"03198de42381.mp3","Here you go — these should help.":"26866157de34.mp3","Thanks — how often should I take them?":"0f1f5f8d31bd.mp3","The pharmacist hands you a box of tablets.. Ask how often to take it.":"c55fb7452979.mp3","Tell me where it hurts.":"47b2e40fe6f6.mp3","It's a sharp pain right here, on my lower back.":"1fbbd49339cc.mp3","The doctor is examining you.. Say where it hurts.":"ecaa002f0c3e.mp3","Alright, anything else?":"a319d5763eda.mp3","Could I get a medical certificate for work, please?":"14c64428e41c.mp3","You need a certificate for work. The doctor finishes up.. Ask for a medical certificate.":"061f15eb5393.mp3","Good morning, Dr Lee's rooms.":"26004cbcc56e.mp3","Hi, I'd like to book a first appointment, please.":"2fdd8c2efd23.mp3","You're calling to see a specialist for the first time.. Say you need a first appointment.":"c5ccda8ccdd1.mp3","Hi there, how can I help?":"2b80147e8b7c.mp3","Hi, I'd like to open an account, please.":"a53dc0a3ced0.mp3","You're at the bank counter.. Say you want to open an account.":"42c3792139af.mp3","Thanks for calling — how can I help?":"0fb5cc949ef8.mp3","Hi, I've lost my card — I need to block it.":"2b05588ec8f2.mp3","Your card is gone. You call the bank, a little worried.. Say your card's lost and block it.":"e84361b73ef0.mp3","Is there anything else?":"05a64e6f78db.mp3","Sorry, what's this charge for?":"118f26c891fc.mp3","There's a charge on your statement you don't recognise.. Ask what the charge is for.":"1409b78823ac.mp3","How can I help you today?":"609d008804d9.mp3","I'd like to withdraw two hundred dollars, please.":"e6a34d7afdd4.mp3","You're at the counter and need some cash.. Ask to withdraw money.":"1d7bc659bea9.mp3","Excuse me, could you break a fifty for me?":"c1a0fd639450.mp3","You need coins. You approach the counter.. Ask to change a fifty.":"ebc4667342eb.mp3","Hi, plumbing services.":"81cf5a6fd31d.mp3","Hi, my kitchen sink is blocked — could someone come out?":"622db4bf4d87.mp3","Your sink is blocked. You call a plumber.. Explain the problem and ask them to come.":"4861c16da94e.mp3","Tech support, how can I help?":"0c4624d22da3.mp3","Hi, my internet's been down since this morning.":"ec31ca2e8d39.mp3","Your internet's been down all morning. You call support.. Report the internet is down.":"7705b6b5d4e8.mp3","Hi, I'm calling about the apartment — is it still available?":"f161bffcc056.mp3","You saw an ad for an apartment. You call the landlord.. Ask if it's still available.":"a56d161549e4.mp3","Oh, hey!":"73f925d2f3f9.mp3","Sorry to bother you — would you mind turning the music down a bit?":"e55e375a963d.mp3","It's late and the music next door is loud. You knock, staying polite.. Ask them to turn it down.":"81518e581b14.mp3","Hey, would you mind taking a parcel for me while I'm away?":"4a0a2570e9a1.mp3","You'll be away when a parcel arrives. You catch your neighbour.. Ask them to take a parcel.":"309df6b53e8a.mp3","Sorry, could I borrow your pen for a sec?":"9f0a29b17d95.mp3","You need a pen and a colleague has one.. Ask to borrow it.":"214db7804966.mp3","Excuse me, could you take a photo of us?":"242fa57d15b3.mp3","You want a group photo. A passer-by is nearby.. Ask them to take a photo.":"64a2a683a80e.mp3","Excuse me, could I get past?":"68000571f304.mp3","A crowded train, you need to reach the door.. Ask to get past.":"bbae19ada8aa.mp3","Excuse me, could you help me reach that?":"44e57db6fea8.mp3","There's a box on a high shelf you can't reach. Someone taller is near.. Ask them to help reach it.":"41d5f1d57c27.mp3","Do you need a hand with those?":"bc7a997aae44.mp3","Someone's struggling with heavy bags near you.. Offer a hand.":"62a786322a78.mp3","I got the job!":"5650fc0b9edf.mp3","That's amazing — congratulations!":"854e78326390.mp3","Your friend just shared great news.. Congratulate them.":"931f98529cf4.mp3","I failed the test.":"091fbbc3e51a.mp3","Oh no, I'm sorry to hear that.":"9294d9ff098d.mp3","A friend tells you something went badly.. Show you're sorry to hear it.":"6d9de0d842b8.mp3","There you are!":"f94d82c1ef17.mp3","I'm so sorry I'm late — the traffic was terrible.":"1bc376d56fc2.mp3","You rush in well after the agreed time.. Apologise with a reason.":"9e0d78303e67.mp3","I'm really sorry about that.":"efa15d0582ea.mp3","It's okay, don't worry about it.":"843e112353af.mp3","Someone apologises for a small mix-up.. Tell them it's fine.":"c6445ce4eb00.mp3","I've been really stressed lately.":"e8a15885fb2c.mp3","That sounds tough — are you okay?":"32b14b289c7e.mp3","A friend seems down and says they're stressed.. Check in on them.":"9f3aaffef316.mp3","Big interview tomorrow...":"fa011c1ad8d0.mp3","Good luck — you'll be great!":"9d0e85620ad6.mp3","A friend has something big tomorrow.. Wish them luck.":"80bd5e17d07e.mp3","I don't think I can do this.":"64d796194d4d.mp3","Don't worry — you've got this.":"3f9d759c58c6.mp3","A friend is nervous and doubting themselves.. Reassure them.":"28787fa76fe2.mp3","Do you want to grab a coffee sometime?":"61e62d6579d7.mp3","You'd like to catch up with someone.. Suggest grabbing a coffee.":"277e3dea9b1c.mp3","We're having dinner Friday — want to come?":"33e60e698097.mp3","Yeah, I'd love to! What time?":"90fe3f21b083.mp3","A friend invites you to dinner.. Say yes and ask the time.":"7f8e9c0f5a61.mp3","Want to come to the party?":"1e3f5b450cee.mp3","I'd love to, but I can't make it this time.":"f18877fd2241.mp3","You're invited but can't go.. Say no, warmly.":"5b6167dfca10.mp3","Still on for tomorrow?":"d277ea1f9958.mp3","Something's come up — could we make it another day?":"2f370b5a2571.mp3","Something came up and you need to move plans.. Ask to do it another day.":"6b34484a0ea5.mp3","See you Saturday then!":"ad33c97ea0d7.mp3","Sounds good — where should we meet?":"3a3119f5b479.mp3","The plan's set, just need a spot.. Ask where to meet.":"aa080e5a2582.mp3","So when works for you?":"8e475197b777.mp3","How about around six?":"e2fd83ebce45.mp3","You're both free but haven't picked a time.. Propose a time.":"85337f34b512.mp3","I'm running a bit late — I'll be there in ten.":"68713ac77c3e.mp3","You're running behind for work. You message your team lead.. Say you're running late.":"7ff5257847e7.mp3","Morning, what's up?":"420a2994c7ce.mp3","Hi, I'm not well — I won't make it in today.":"027e5db8a049.mp3","You're unwell and can't work today. You call your boss.. Say you can't come in.":"5dc864614efc.mp3","How's it going with that?":"c846587a83ca.mp3","Good — I'm almost done, just finishing up.":"a27eb37c6504.mp3","Your boss checks how the task is going.. Give a quick status.":"76998f9cc095.mp3","Can you put this together?":"ea87629c2667.mp3","Sure — how would you like it done?":"05987c7096ab.mp3","You've been handed a task but aren't sure of the format.. Ask how they want it done.":"9f31aea0ae44.mp3","Excuse me, how long does it take to get to the city?":"b3ba9bc5d6e9.mp3","You're checking a trip before you set off. You ask a local.. Ask how long it takes.":"4571de9284f8.mp3","Excuse me, which stop do I get off for the museum?":"234974693d10.mp3","You're not sure where to get off for the museum. You ask the driver.. Ask which stop to get off at.":"298532b2c854.mp3","So, tell me a little about yourself.":"9442127bc792.mp3","I would describe myself as a reliable, organised person.":"45a524fd10c3.mp3","The interview begins. The interviewer wants to get to know you.. Introduce yourself.":"ef0a798be6fe.mp3","What's your background?":"8f28c5a78949.mp3","I have experience in customer service and teamwork.":"f73b3c7361e5.mp3","The interviewer asks about your background.. State your experience.":"275aab6e22ac.mp3","What can you bring to this role?":"2945640f2607.mp3","One skill I can bring to this role is clear communication.":"eaae0fc9ed26.mp3","The interviewer wants to know what you'd add to the team.. Name a skill you bring.":"5c9699ea3dc0.mp3","Why did you apply for this position?":"37b48bb2498f.mp3","I'm interested in this position because it matches my long-term goals.":"9cc76cce8559.mp3","The interviewer asks why you applied.. Say why you're interested.":"b2350d9d11f7.mp3","Tell me about your last job.":"34cb558f1841.mp3","In my previous role, I worked as a team leader.":"c8033715ce6c.mp3","The interviewer moves on to your work history.. Mention your previous role.":"c614fb539a11.mp3","What did that job involve?":"726dba4e3b15.mp3","I was responsible for managing the daily schedule.":"cd862649a239.mp3","They ask what the job involved.. Say what you were responsible for.":"6ce3cb4773b1.mp3","And what did that include?":"e6eb3bbee143.mp3","This involved coordinating a small team.":"e91c1416dfba.mp3","They want more detail on what you did.. Explain what it involved.":"c56dfe2cdbf3.mp3","What was the main focus?":"215c1bff882b.mp3","A key part of my role was keeping customers happy.":"ef7e8cf46608.mp3","They ask about the main focus of your role.. Name a key part of the role.":"9aeff40e746f.mp3","Can you give me an example?":"a45cc2c28e26.mp3","A good example of this is a project I led last year.":"063726c56737.mp3","The interviewer asks you to back it up.. Introduce an example.":"b19995d61243.mp3","When have you shown that?":"7e37cb190857.mp3","One situation that demonstrates this was a busy holiday period.":"f7820e3dce9b.mp3","They want a specific situation.. Point to a situation.":"4e1cba623194.mp3","Such as?":"4c7b744af2ca.mp3","For example, when we were short-staffed, I stepped in to help.":"fd33cec74e51.mp3","They prompt you for an instance.. Give a quick example.":"01b816ff6926.mp3","How did you show that?":"e61a2989932a.mp3","I demonstrated this by taking on extra responsibility.":"0610156f7263.mp3","They ask how you showed that quality.. Say how you showed it.":"0fe7c11593b5.mp3","What was your role in that?":"a3077601c2bc.mp3","My responsibility was to keep the project on track.":"a4836e723c2b.mp3","They dig into what you actually did.. State your responsibility.":"ef94bb5fb167.mp3","So what did you do?":"0cd2d32a0cf5.mp3","I decided to reorganise the workflow.":"5df4cf667a99.mp3","They ask about your decision.. Say what you decided.":"d0cbb11d0703.mp3","How did you approach it?":"c69d691e436c.mp3","The steps I took were to plan, delegate, and review.":"ce865989119e.mp3","They want to know your approach.. List the steps you took.":"3a9cfb158301.mp3","Did you handle it alone?":"f4fa5471f9cf.mp3","I worked with my team to solve the problem.":"61bbb7c72165.mp3","They ask whether you did it alone.. Say who you worked with.":"a6921eeb6e52.mp3","And what was the result?":"4ffc1591bdde.mp3","As a result, we finished ahead of schedule.":"d1cb192dc518.mp3","They ask how it turned out.. State the result.":"32817bf7dd9d.mp3","What did that achieve?":"913485f25b8c.mp3","This led to happier customers and better reviews.":"b64d658bcaaa.mp3","They ask what it achieved.. Say what it led to.":"f7869f61ee14.mp3","Ho